<title>GERMANY: Independence of Bundesbank important asset - Kohl.</title>
<headline>Independence of Bundesbank important asset - Kohl.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor Helmut Kohl said on Wednesday the independence of the German central bank was an important asset and that this would not change.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bundesbank's independence is an important asset and will remain so,&quot; Kohl told the Bundestag lower house of parliament before a vote on a motion proposed by opposition Social Democrats and Greens that Waigel should be sacked.</p>
</text>
